### Camrea command status
POST http://garmin-wifi/virb
Content-Type: text/json; charset=utf-8

{"command":"status"}

### Camrea command features
POST http://garmin-wifi/virb
Content-Type: text/json; charset=utf-8

{"command":"features"}

### Camera command livePreview
POST http://garmin-wifi/virb
Content-Type: text/json; charset=utf-8

{"command":"livePreview","streamType": "rtp","maxResolutionVertical":
"1920", "liveStreamActive": "0" }

### Camera command sensors
POST http://garmin-wifi/virb
Content-Type: text/json; charset=utf-8

{"command":"sensors"}

### Camera command networks
POST http://garmin-wifi/virb
Content-Type: text/json; charset=utf-8

{"command":"networks", "subCommand": "getScannegetApSSID"}

### Camera command mediaList
POST http://garmin-wifi/virb
Content-Type: text/json; charset=utf-8

{"command":"mediaList"}

### Camera command deviceInfo
POST http://garmin-wifi/virb
Content-Type: text/json; charset=utf-8

{"command":"deviceInfo"}

### Camera command commandList
POST http://garmin-wifi/virb
Content-Type: text/json; charset=utf-8

{"command":"commandList"}